diff --git a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
--- a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -6,6 +6,10 @@
 
 - Added `discovery.ownedBy` to filter `openai-models-list` and `proxy` catalogs by `owned_by`, so one gateway can provide separate vendor providers without explicit model lists.
 - Added `discovery.authoritative` so a configured provider lists only the rows its discovery returned, hiding the bundled roster of a built-in provider id such as `openai`.
+
+### Changed
+
+- Halved `find` judgment batches (32 files per filename request, 9 KB sketch and 16 KB verification state) so each request stays near 5k tokens and fits an 8k-context judge such as self-hosted Clef, and raised the `find` timeout from 20 s to 90 s for a judge that answers one request at a time.
 
 ## [18.10.4] - 2026-10-13
 
